      "field": {
        "value": "#6c6278",
        "comment": "The strong border, #393044, lightened dE 18.61: the least move that clears 3:1 on every rung a text field sits on (3.00:1 on the raised rung, the worst). A field stands on a rung and never inside a hovered or pressed row, so it is held to the rungs alone rather than to the composites the control boundary clears, and it reads as quietly as a secondary button's edge allows."
